{"title": "Robert", "pageid": 2040, "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Robert</b> is a Prince of <a href=\"/wiki/Yander\" title=\"Yander\">Yander</a> as well as Brother to <a href=\"/wiki/Pavel\" title=\"Pavel\">Pavel</a>. He patrols the <a href=\"/wiki/Losiniy_Forrest\" title=\"Losiniy Forrest\">Forrest of Losiniy</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Inagentiy\" title=\"Inagentiy\">Inagentiy</a> with his Storm Hounds.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<dl><dd><div class=\"notice metadata plainlinks\" id=\"stub\"><i>This article is a <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Article_stubs\" title=\"Category:Article stubs\">stub</a>. You can help Amberpedia Wiki by  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://princeofamber.fandom.com/wiki/Robert?action=edit\">expanding it</a>.</i></div></dd></dl>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260501231346\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.007 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.010 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 8/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 321/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    1.965      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    1.965      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.1_prod_princeofamber:pcache:idhash:2040-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260501231346 and revision id 4457. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>", "sections": [], "links": [{"ns": 14, "title": "Category:Article stubs", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "Yander", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "Losiniy Forrest", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "Pavel", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "Inagentiy", "exists": true}], "url": "https: